          "status": "outside",
          "text": "Nothing in URML counts toward a performance level or a SIL. The URML validator and runtimes are not safety-related parts of the control system. They are left out of every performance level and safety integrity level calculation, and no safety function depends on them."
        },
        {
          "detail": {
            "cite": {
              "standard": [
                "IEC 61508-3:2010"
              ],
              "text": "IEC 61508-3:2010, clause 6.2",
              "url": null
