            "input": "rulebook:cell_7_safety"
          },
          "status": "outside",
          "text": "Each safety function is designed to its required level. Each safety function the risk assessment calls for is specified, designed and implemented in safety-related control to reach its required performance level or safety integrity level."
        },
        {
          "detail": {
            "cite": {
              "standard": [
